                'To show the product photo, add an Image layer (any placeholder picture) and give it the custom class zpp-upsell-image in its Advanced tab.' => __('To show the product photo, add an Image layer (any placeholder picture) and give it the custom class zpp-upsell-image in its Advanced tab.', 'zappoppop'),
